ed fighter who wields twin photon-blade Armaments."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87655"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ベランジェ―ルの懐刀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"２本のフォトンブレード（短い柄の先から粒子を放出して光の刃を形成）型のアーマメントを巧みに操る二刀流の使い手"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22102","sourceWorkId":"29039","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f70fc20ae1f7ac8b169d6dce08f9d16f93b942437726af874a585d3829c0cd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e3895d858fc4bd24d60b37b9d24c76d4641b958d98cb269abc811b9dce98ea7.webp","width":210,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みたかりん","creatorId":"vndb:s5060","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5060","name":"みたか りん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:297023:150482:25596:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87656","characterName":"ベランジェール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"150481","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"297023"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22103"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87656"},"originalCharacterName":"ベランジェール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A gifted beauty. She strives towards realising the aim of the world's complete subjugation by women aspiring to the position of Queen, to this end she denigrates all men under the harsh yoke of city rule as \"defects\" and \"males\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87656"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗な才女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クイーンの目指す女性による世界の完全支配を実現すべく、この都市を厳しい統制下に置いている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男を『劣等種』『オス』と呼び蔑んでいる"}],"s